  "query_preview": "..\nAn unstable weather pattern due to nearby Invest 97W will bring\nscattered showers and isolated thunderstorms tonight for the Marianas\nwith slightly higher chances for Guam. High end scattered showers \nand isolated thunderstorms are expected to continue through Thursday\nas a monsoon-like pattern brings moisture and southwesterly winds \ninto the area. Some uncertainty remains as to where exactly the surge\nwill develop over the Marianas and whether winds will be gusty or\nnot. This will depend on the strength and location of 97W over the\nnext few days. This monsoon pattern may shift out of the Marianas\nlate this week or over the weekend bringing dryer air and isolated\nshowers and thunderstorms.",
